WEBVTT

01:03.520 --> 01:05.280
Young General, are you there?

01:05.280 --> 01:06.880
The General wants to see you.

01:07.320 --> 01:08.240
Young General.

01:21.560 --> 01:23.520
This kid's breathing is chaotic.

01:23.520 --> 01:24.840
He is indeed very weak.

01:25.960 --> 01:29.280
Whether he colluded with Ji Mingyue,

01:29.280 --> 01:32.479
and whether he is from the Helian clan,

01:32.479 --> 01:34.039
let's test him.

01:37.280 --> 01:38.200
General,

01:38.200 --> 01:40.200
please save our Young General.

01:40.680 --> 01:43.600
Jiuying is my beloved general.

01:43.920 --> 01:45.380
I will naturally save him.

01:46.039 --> 01:46.960
Guards.

01:46.960 --> 01:48.080
Yes.

01:48.080 --> 01:49.880
Send Jiuying to Wuse City.

01:50.400 --> 01:53.259
There is a royal doctor from the capital in the city.

01:53.560 --> 01:55.560
Let him treat Jiuying well.

01:56.120 --> 01:58.360
Don't let anything go wrong.

01:58.720 --> 01:59.400
Yes, sir.

02:19.600 --> 02:21.240
Your Highness, I've brought

02:21.480 --> 02:22.810
the thing you asked for.

03:18.960 --> 03:20.640
This edict is real.

03:24.400 --> 03:26.460
Huo Lingyu is from the Hanlin Academy

03:26.720 --> 03:28.120
and has seen many edicts.

03:28.680 --> 03:30.640
Even he couldn't find any problems.

03:30.640 --> 03:32.120
It seems that my posthumous edict

03:32.120 --> 03:33.880
is completely convincing.

03:42.040 --> 03:43.480
Hahaha.

03:43.480 --> 03:44.340
Your Highness.

03:44.520 --> 03:46.360
You were so hard to find.

03:47.920 --> 03:49.000
General Baili,

03:49.720 --> 03:51.120
I trust you've been well.

03:58.760 --> 04:00.960
The late Emperor's edict is right here.

04:03.920 --> 04:04.720
Now,

04:05.040 --> 04:06.700
the Shenji Camp is in my hands,

04:06.800 --> 04:09.060
and the military tally is in my hands too.

04:09.200 --> 04:12.080
What will General Baili do?

04:12.600 --> 04:14.200
You need to think clearly.

04:21.360 --> 04:22.089
[Cheng Se Wu]

04:26.560 --> 04:28.080
The Imperial Physician has returned to the capital.

04:28.080 --> 04:28.840
Yes.

04:28.840 --> 04:31.720
Three days ago, an urgent edict suddenly arrived from the capital.

04:31.720 --> 04:34.200
The Imperial Physician then returned with the envoy.

04:34.200 --> 04:36.480
Your Young Master Helian was born frail.

04:36.480 --> 04:39.080
The court sent the Imperial Physician to prolong his life.

04:39.080 --> 04:40.520
Now that the Imperial Physician is gone,

04:40.520 --> 04:42.280
what about your Young Master's injuries?

04:42.280 --> 04:43.340
Who will treat him?

04:46.159 --> 04:47.200
I don't know.

04:47.200 --> 04:48.680
To treat the Young Master,

04:48.680 --> 04:52.210
the High Priest has been in seclusion with him for several days.

04:58.080 --> 04:59.800
The General ordered before his departure

04:59.800 --> 05:01.920
that after the Young General arrives at the Helian Clan,

05:01.920 --> 05:04.000
he would dispatch troops to surround Wuse City.

05:04.000 --> 05:06.360
If the Young General shows any hesitation,

05:06.360 --> 05:07.960
he is to be killed on the spot.

05:08.520 --> 05:11.780
I presume the General's elite troops will arrive shortly.

05:24.360 --> 05:26.620
General, have you thought this through?

05:27.240 --> 05:28.970
The military tally was stolen.

05:29.120 --> 05:32.120
The late emperor's edict's authenticity is unknown.

05:32.320 --> 05:36.380
Actually, you only have the Shenji Battalion under your command, right?

05:38.159 --> 05:41.020
There is no point in you talking like this, General.

05:41.600 --> 05:43.680
If I were of no use,

05:44.800 --> 05:47.800
why would you eagerly invite me to the North?

05:49.680 --> 05:50.760
General Baili.

05:51.520 --> 05:52.760
With me here,

05:53.320 --> 05:56.450
your march on the Capital will be completely justified.

05:56.920 --> 05:57.920
Without me,

05:58.400 --> 06:00.060
you are nothing but a traitor.

06:01.440 --> 06:03.040
As for the military tally...

06:04.600 --> 06:07.400
Then it depends on how the general acts.

06:08.600 --> 06:09.800
How dare you threaten me?

06:09.800 --> 06:11.280
So what if I threaten you?

06:19.400 --> 06:20.320
Bring them up.

06:20.840 --> 06:21.280
Yes.

06:37.960 --> 06:40.360
Bring the military seal first.

07:41.360 --> 07:43.560
So this is the legendary Eagle Eye.

07:44.240 --> 07:47.080
I really don't like the look of it.

07:47.760 --> 07:50.080
Why don't I gouge it out?

07:54.520 --> 07:56.360
I hate you the most,

07:57.960 --> 08:00.560
but I am also most gratified to have raised you.

08:01.720 --> 08:04.000
You are more like me than Jin.

08:04.960 --> 08:08.920
We women of the Shen family never bow to men,

08:10.080 --> 08:11.480
refuse to be threatened,

08:12.880 --> 08:15.280
and don't accept fate.

08:29.040 --> 08:31.240
Don't even think

08:31.920 --> 08:35.559
about using me to threaten anyone.

08:41.480 --> 08:42.280
Hmph.

08:44.960 --> 08:46.160
Your Highness,

08:46.840 --> 08:49.160
you are truly a master of politics.

08:49.400 --> 08:53.040
To remain unfazed while your own mother dies before your eyes,

08:53.560 --> 08:55.420
you are indeed heartless enough.

09:04.440 --> 09:05.880
Done showing off?

09:07.080 --> 09:07.960
Now,

09:08.680 --> 09:11.280
it's time to sit down and discuss cooperation.

09:38.960 --> 09:42.720
We women of the Shen family never bow to men,

09:43.880 --> 09:45.280
refuse to be threatened,

09:47.320 --> 09:49.320
and do not yield to fate.

10:06.640 --> 10:09.170
Helian Jin's antidote hasn't been found yet.

10:09.440 --> 10:12.770
He will likely continue to be controlled by Baili Jinghong.

10:13.280 --> 10:15.840
I shouldn't have pinned my hopes on him.

10:36.680 --> 10:37.880
Eldest Young Master.

10:38.840 --> 10:40.040
Eldest Young Master.

10:40.800 --> 10:43.080
The general's spies are all around the mansion.

10:43.080 --> 10:44.280
I can't get out at all.

10:44.840 --> 10:45.440
Right now,

10:45.880 --> 10:49.140
we have no way to know the Second Young Master's situation.

10:50.080 --> 10:51.200
I must go see Aman

10:51.600 --> 10:52.440
and Mingyue.

10:53.240 --> 10:54.300
I came so suddenly.

10:54.520 --> 10:56.680
I'm afraid I won't make it back within three days.

10:56.680 --> 10:58.210
I need to send her a message.

11:01.360 --> 11:02.560
Cover for me for a bit.

11:02.720 --> 11:03.780
I'll be right back.

11:04.280 --> 11:05.040
Eldest Young Master,

11:05.040 --> 11:07.440
are you going to use your secret arts again?

11:14.160 --> 11:15.480
If Her Highness treated you

11:15.480 --> 11:17.480
even a third as well as you treat her,

11:17.640 --> 11:19.570
I wouldn't be so worried about you.

11:42.520 --> 11:43.320
Father.

11:43.720 --> 11:44.880
What are you doing?

11:47.520 --> 11:49.640
I have tried everything.

11:50.280 --> 11:51.960
But failed.

11:53.080 --> 11:54.480
I am old.

11:55.160 --> 11:58.160
It is worth trading my life for yours.

11:58.400 --> 11:59.560
No.

11:59.760 --> 12:01.520
It's retribution.

12:02.880 --> 12:04.560
Haven't you always wanted to know

12:04.560 --> 12:07.240
how your eldest brother left back then?

12:08.200 --> 12:09.080
Back then,

12:09.680 --> 12:11.240
you were weak and sick.

12:12.360 --> 12:14.820
And I still held a grudge against his mother.

12:16.680 --> 12:18.520
When he was fifteen,

12:19.040 --> 12:21.960
I plotted to transfer his blood to you.

12:23.000 --> 12:25.800
So you wouldn't have to suffer physical pain

12:26.160 --> 12:27.760
and be in agony anymore.

12:29.120 --> 12:30.920
But he was truly strong.

12:32.040 --> 12:35.080
At such a young age, his skills were extraordinary.

12:35.160 --> 12:38.360
Facing the siege of the ten deadly assassins of the Helian clan,

12:38.360 --> 12:40.280
he still managed to escape.

12:41.120 --> 12:45.080
He guessed someone in the clan wanted his life,

12:45.920 --> 12:48.760
so he fled overnight.

12:51.880 --> 12:52.680
Father.

12:53.520 --> 12:54.320
Father.

12:54.400 --> 12:55.280
Man'er.

12:56.840 --> 12:58.800
Remember my words.

12:59.280 --> 13:02.320
No one will truly protect us.

13:02.800 --> 13:05.760
Always leave a way out for yourself.

13:06.560 --> 13:08.120
An innocent man

13:08.880 --> 13:10.600
is ruined by his wealth.

13:11.600 --> 13:13.320
My Helian clan,

13:15.240 --> 13:18.400
how did it come to this?

13:21.600 --> 13:22.400
Father.

13:23.000 --> 13:23.800
Father.

13:24.680 --> 13:25.480
Father.

13:26.360 --> 13:27.160
Father.

13:28.200 --> 13:29.200
Father.

13:36.440 --> 13:38.840
Father.

13:41.760 --> 13:43.200
Father.

13:44.160 --> 13:45.000
Brother.

13:45.080 --> 13:45.880
Hurry.

13:46.360 --> 13:47.160
Hurry.

13:47.160 --> 13:47.890
Stop Father!

13:49.600 --> 13:50.400
Brother.

13:50.560 --> 13:51.360
Are you okay?

13:53.160 --> 13:53.960
Brother.

13:56.400 --> 13:57.720
Save Father quickly!

13:58.880 --> 14:01.680
Don't waste your effort. Father.

14:02.160 --> 14:04.320
Once this method starts,

14:05.160 --> 14:06.620
it cannot be interrupted.

14:07.600 --> 14:09.320
Trading life for life.

14:10.440 --> 14:12.800
Are you going to watch

14:12.800 --> 14:15.240
your brother die?

14:17.400 --> 14:18.840
What secret art is this?

14:19.720 --> 14:21.960
Trading life for life.

14:25.520 --> 14:26.320
Mother.

14:27.120 --> 14:28.780
No wonder my poison was cured.

14:30.720 --> 14:31.880
You came back

14:33.000 --> 14:35.400
to ask how to save her?

14:36.280 --> 14:38.120
She can't be saved.

14:38.880 --> 14:42.200
This method is irreversible.

14:45.360 --> 14:47.200
Don't even think about

14:50.080 --> 14:51.800
returning it.

14:56.240 --> 14:57.040
Father.

14:57.520 --> 14:59.280
Father.

15:00.240 --> 15:01.240
Father.

15:03.680 --> 15:04.680
Father.

15:19.960 --> 15:21.120
Wu Lie said

15:21.840 --> 15:23.900
when he first met you, Your Highness,

15:24.240 --> 15:26.120
you were traveling with Jiuying,

15:27.320 --> 15:30.560
digging a gold mine for the bandits of Mount Beimang.

15:30.760 --> 15:33.000
Now the gold has been refined,

15:33.720 --> 15:35.380
and the quality is quite good.

15:36.440 --> 15:38.720
General, you have many strong soldiers

15:39.040 --> 15:40.700
and wealth rivaling a nation.

15:40.720 --> 15:41.600
I am impressed.

15:46.400 --> 15:48.660
Helian Jie captured you, Your Highness.

15:48.720 --> 15:50.780
You have suffered a great injustice.

15:51.640 --> 15:52.480
Rest assured.

15:53.640 --> 15:56.320
I have already dispatched troops to Wuse City,

15:57.360 --> 15:59.490
and ordered Jiuying to accompany them

16:00.440 --> 16:03.960
to capture the High Priest and Helian Jie,

16:04.480 --> 16:06.840
and vent this anger for you, Your Highness.
